# Meson writes into this directory during a build: downloaded fallback subprojects (glm-*, v4l-utils/,
# packagecache/ ...), redirect .wrap files for nested subprojects promoted from wlroots
# (libdisplay-info.wrap, libliftoff.wrap, v4l-utils.wrap ...) and .wraplock.
# Ignore everything, then un-ignore what is tracked. A new tracked file here needs a "!" line below.
# ritz-get treats a clone with untracked files as modified and skips updates (SPEC R6).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/catch2.wrap
!/glm.wrap
!/imgui.wrap
!/nlohmann_json.wrap
!/stb.wrap
!/packagefiles
!/FrameGen
!/libdisplay-info
!/libliftoff
!/openvr
!/vkroots
!/wlroots
